  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"archive-header\">\n\n\t<h1 class=\"archive-title\">Julie Blanchard</h1>\n\n\t\n\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article class=\"entry author-pwsbuilder has-excerpt post-4112 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-education category-monthly-meetings category-news tag-art-cape-cod tag-harwich-community-center tag-julie-blanchard\" id=\"post-4112\">\n\n\t\n\t\t<a href=\"/news/february-guest-artist-julie-blanchard/\"><img class=\"portrait cw-greater thumbnail stargazer-full\" width=\"338\" height=\"500\" alt=\"A watercolor painting of flowers in a vase.\" src=\"/media/archive/2a76972f23b3f4a95d3395b15fee510cf513b77b163e0ce3f928c51b29b68afe.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a>\n\t\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/news/february-guest-artist-julie-blanchard/\" rel=\"bookmark\">February Guest Artist, Julie Blanchard</a></h2>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2019-02-06T21:44:32-05:00\" title=\"Wednesday, February 6, 2019, 9:44 pm\">February 6, 2019</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-summary\">\n\t\t\t<p>Julie Blanchard joins us as the February guest artist. The Guild of Harwich Artists hold monthly meetings January through May, and September through November, at the Harwich Community Center, 100 Oak Street, Harwich, MA. Each meeting features a well-known Cape artist demonstrator. All programs are free and open to the public. #ForArtAndCommunity #GuildOfHarwichArtists #CapeCod</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\n</article>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\t\n",
